    "faq_detail_diy_JaQWnL": {
      "type": "faq-detail-diy",
      "blocks": {
        "item_DRBtP4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is Ulike ReGlow?",
            "content": "<p>Backed by Dr. Michael R. Hamblin, renowned pioneer in light therapy, ReGlow is an FDA cleared and affordable home use device that uses light emitting diodes (LED) to reduce fine lines, wrinkles, and acne, and improve overall skin tone, firmness, and health.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_QwBpjM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does Ulike LED Light Therapy work?",
            "content": "<p>Ulike ReGlow Mask works by emitting LED light at specific wavelengths that penetrate the skin to stimulate cellular activity, promote collagen production, or reduce inflammation and bacteria. Each light color targets different skin concerns for customized skincare benefits.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_RcnBXG": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are its main benefits?",
            "content": "<p>Ulike ReGlow Mask uses multi-wavelength light therapy to deliver visible results such as firming, soothing, acne control, and brightening. With consistent use, it helps improve overall skin texture and radiance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_JHDqQg": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use the ReGlow Mask during menstruation, pregnancy, or breastfeeding?",
            "content": "<p>It is not recommended to use our device during menstruation, pregnancy, or breastfeeding. Hormonal fluctuations during these periods may increase skin sensitivity, potentially leading to discomfort or adverse reactions. To ensure safety, it is advised to consult a healthcare professional before use, to determine if it is suitable based on your individual health condition.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_kD6UHx": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the recommended treatment schedule for ReGlow?",
            "content": "<p>It is recommended to use the device 3 times a week. You can choose the mode based on your skin condition. Glow and Clear modes last 5 minutes each, and Firm and Rejuvenate modes last 8 minutes each. For best results, use 1–2 modes per session, not exceeding 20 minutes in total.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_nHKPXa": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can Ulike ReGlow be used on sensitive skin?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, individuals with sensitive skin can use the device. </p><p>However, during sensitive skin periods, avoid using Clear Mode. Other modes are safe for use.ts.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_XWGLc7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I perform a patch test?",
            "content": "<p>Before using on the face, it is recommended to test on the inner arm. Clean and dry the skin, then use any mode for 3–5 minutes. If there is no irritation within 24 hours, you can proceed to use it on the face.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_kBVEWA": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who should avoid using Ulike ReGlow Mask?",
            "content": "<p>The following groups should avoid using the device:</p><ul><li>Individuals with heart diseases, heart dysfunction, or those prone to dysfunction</li><li>People who are intoxicated or unconscious</li><li>People who cannot sense temperature or stimuli</li><li>Individuals with autoimmune diseases</li><li>Please avoid using the device within 2 weeks after surgery</li></ul><p>If you are unsure whether it’s suitable for you, consult a healthcare professional before use.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
